{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Bear Defence Situation",
    "steam_appid": 3778320,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778320/extras/31bf7a1365df330c021ac1adf69d03d6.avif?t=1752171329\" width=600 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bear Defence Situation</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilding tower defence that lets you bend its rules as much as it bends its genre.\u00a0 Play your cards right and you'll be knocking out enemies with satisfying shots in search of killer strategies and wild combinations.\u00a0 Use the powers of the elements within your cards and your towers to protect this little bear and their den.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778320/extras/0bd3092b6144b27c2b7c082e33096a5a.poster.avif?t=1752171329\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778320/extras/0bd3092b6144b27c2b7c082e33096a5a.webm?t=1752171329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778320/extras/0bd3092b6144b27c2b7c082e33096a5a.mp4?t=1752171329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bear's den is special.\u00a0 It's not just a shop or a place for bear to sleep - there's a magical wishing well that will give you unbelievable power (if you have enough gold to make the right wish, that is).\u00a0 You can cast spells to modify your deck.\u00a0 Find treasure, valuable cards, and supplies to upgrade your towers.\u00a0 The bear has a few items laying around they'd be willing to sell, too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778320/extras/4507552419e8c051285fdd5b2091f832.avif?t=1752171329\" width=600 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're going to need all of those things to handle the enemies coming down the path.\u00a0 With inherent abilities and random modifiers, these enemies will test whether your strategy is strong enough to handle anything.\u00a0 Hope you have time to prepare before the boss waves start!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778320/extras/57099beb64d4460c0f0c87c8bc4f6ea3.avif?t=1752171329\" width=600 height=193 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bear Defence Situation is a game that rewards success.\u00a0 Show off your prowess with unlockable hats and alternate tower models earned by various in-game achievements.\u00a0 And this game will give you some time to show off - multiple difficulties and maps are available, along with a set of unique challenge runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778320/extras/712fb4375ac354e184fdaf85fbaf0e46.avif?t=1752171329\" width=600 height=193 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental towers with upgradeable stats and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several layers of card upgrades, including materials and runes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulties, maps, and challenge runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable starter decks with individual benefits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied enemies and bosses with unique abilities to counter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetics earned through in-game achievements</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778320/extras/31bf7a1365df330c021ac1adf69d03d6.avif?t=1752171329\" width=600 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bear Defence Situation</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilding tower defence that lets you bend its rules as much as it bends its genre.\u00a0 Play your cards right and you'll be knocking out enemies with satisfying shots in search of killer strategies and wild combinations.\u00a0 Use the powers of the elements within your cards and your towers to protect this little bear and their den.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778320/extras/0bd3092b6144b27c2b7c082e33096a5a.poster.avif?t=1752171329\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778320/extras/0bd3092b6144b27c2b7c082e33096a5a.webm?t=1752171329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778320/extras/0bd3092b6144b27c2b7c082e33096a5a.mp4?t=1752171329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bear's den is special.\u00a0 It's not just a shop or a place for bear to sleep - there's a magical wishing well that will give you unbelievable power (if you have enough gold to make the right wish, that is).\u00a0 You can cast spells to modify your deck.\u00a0 Find treasure, valuable cards, and supplies to upgrade your towers.\u00a0 The bear has a few items laying around they'd be willing to sell, too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778320/extras/4507552419e8c051285fdd5b2091f832.avif?t=1752171329\" width=600 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're going to need all of those things to handle the enemies coming down the path.\u00a0 With inherent abilities and random modifiers, these enemies will test whether your strategy is strong enough to handle anything.\u00a0 Hope you have time to prepare before the boss waves start!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778320/extras/57099beb64d4460c0f0c87c8bc4f6ea3.avif?t=1752171329\" width=600 height=193 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bear Defence Situation is a game that rewards success.\u00a0 Show off your prowess with unlockable hats and alternate tower models earned by various in-game achievements.\u00a0 And this game will give you some time to show off - multiple difficulties and maps are available, along with a set of unique challenge runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778320/extras/712fb4375ac354e184fdaf85fbaf0e46.avif?t=1752171329\" width=600 height=193 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental towers with upgradeable stats and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several layers of card upgrades, including materials and runes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulties, maps, and challenge runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable starter decks with individual benefits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied enemies and bosses with unique abilities to counter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetics earned through in-game achievements</p></li></ul>",
